---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Experience">
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold text-slate-900">Experience</h1>
  <p class="mt-2 text-slate-500">Professional career and leadership roles</p>

  <div class="mt-8 space-y-10">
    <article>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900">Technology Leadership</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mt-1">Present</p>
      <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600">
        Focused on enterprise AI systems, agentic architectures, data modernization, and connecting technical capabilities to organizational outcomes. Public technical work emphasizes practical implementation, evaluation, and reliable deployment of AI systems.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900">U.S. Army</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mt-1">Officer</p>
      <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600">
        Leadership and technical roles supporting operational and organizational requirements. Descriptions of service are limited to publicly releasable information.
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>

  <p class="mt-12 text-sm text-slate-500">
    Additional details will be added as verified public references become available. All content is presented in a personal capacity.
  </p>
</Layout>
